- Power_Usage: Abnormally high or low power consumption can indicate malfunction or inefficiency, possibly signaling risk. Moderate power usage suggests normal operation.
- Humidity: High humidity can cause corrosion or electrical issues, increasing failure risk. Lower humidity is safer.
